#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/collections_panel.rst:7
msgid "Collections panel"
msgstr "收藏面板"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/collections_panel.rst:9
msgid ""
"The collections panel displays the `QET`_, `user`_ and `projects`_ element "
"collections."
msgstr "集合面板显示 `QET <QET_>`_，`用户 <user_>`_ 和 `项目 <projects_>`_ 元件集合。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/collections_panel.rst:14
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech collections panel"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech收藏面板"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/collections_panel.rst:16
msgid "To display or hidden the collections panel:"
msgstr "要显示或隐藏收藏面板："

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/collections_panel.rst:18
msgid "Select **Settings > Display > Collections** menu item."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 收藏** 菜单项。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/collections_panel.rst:20
msgid ""
"The main function from the collections panel is to manage `elements`_. The "
"tasks which can be done from collections panel are:"
msgstr "收藏面板的主要功能是管理 `元件 <elements_>`_。收藏面板可以完成的任务有：收藏面板："

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/collections_panel.rst:23
msgid ""
"Manage `user`_ collection (Create, edit and delete elements from the "
"collection)."
msgstr "管理 `用户 <user_>`_ 集合(创建，编辑和删除集合中的元素)."

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/collections_panel.rst:24
msgid "Edit elements from project collection."
msgstr "从元件集合中编辑元素 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/collections_panel.rst:25
msgid "Search elements from the project collection at the `workspace`_."
msgstr "从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 的元件集合中查找元素。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/collections_panel.rst:26
msgid ""
"Import elements from `QET`_ or `user`_ collection to the project (Add new "
"element to workspace)."
msgstr "从 `QET <QET_>`_ 或 `用户 <user_>`_ 收集元素导入到项目(添加新元素到工作空间) 。"

#: ../../source/users/interface/panels/collections_panel.rst:28
msgid ""
"To make easier the work with the collections panel, QElectroTech provides a "
"search tool that makes faster finding elements inside the different "
"collections."
msgstr "为了方便收藏面板的工作，QEelectroTech提供了一个搜索工具，使不同收藏内部的查找元素更快。"
